# Single-File Canvas App

- Keep the app dependency-light: plain DOM code first, third-party scripts only when clearly justified.
- Prefer extending existing `state`, event wiring, and element-rendering flows over parallel abstractions.
- For styling, reuse existing CSS variables and component patterns before adding new colors, spacing values, or one-off classes.
- When adding UI controls, keep toolbar and modal markup compact and consistent with existing button and input styles.
- Avoid large architectural rewrites inside `canvas.html` unless the task explicitly asks for restructuring.
